/*
hostRequirements
----------------

Define the minimum host resources the dev-container needs.

You can set:

  • cpu        – minimum number of CPU cores
  • memoryGB   – minimum RAM (GB)
  • storageGB  – minimum disk space (GB)
  • gpu        – required GPU type, or `true` if any GPU is needed

If the host falls short of these limits, the IDE will show a warning.
*/

{
  "name": "1_25-spec_hostRequirements",
  "image": "ubuntu:latest",
  "hostRequirements": {
    "cpus": 4,
    "memory": "8gb",
    "storage": "32gb",
    "gpu": "optional"
  }
}
